  <with|font-series|bold|font-size|1.19|Optical size: opsz=auto against the default>

  <with|font|System Font|font-size|2|font-variations|opsz=auto|Handgloves opsz=auto> <with|font|System Font|font-size|2|Handgloves default>

  <with|font|System Font|font-size|0.7|font-variations|opsz=auto|Small text with opsz=auto: sturdier and wider.> <with|font|System Font|font-size|0.7|Small text with the default design.>

  <with|font-series|bold|font-size|1.19|Numeric series on a static family: font-series 400, 700>

  <with|font|TeX Gyre Pagella|font-series|400|Pagella 400 Hamburgefonstiv> <with|font|TeX Gyre Pagella|font-series|700|Pagella 700 Hamburgefonstiv>
